---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service & Disclaimer | Net Worth Calculator" description="Terms of service and financial benchmark disclaimers for NetWorth. All data is provided for educational and benchmarking purposes only.">
	<main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-20">
		<header class="text-center mb-12 space-y-2">
			<h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">Terms of Service & Financial Disclaimer</h1>
			<p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-400">Effective Date: {new Date().getFullYear()}</p>
		</header>

		<div class="p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800/80 bg-white/95 dark:bg-slate-900/60 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-xl text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300 space-y-6 font-normal leading-relaxed">
			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">1. Educational & Benchmark Purpose Only</h2>
				<p>NetWorth is provided for informational and benchmark comparison purposes only. Calculations are based on statistical sampling from the US Federal Reserve Survey of Consumer Finances (SCF). This tool does not constitute individualized financial, investment, tax, or legal advice.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">2. No Financial Advisor Relationship</h2>
				<p>Use of this site does not create a fiduciary or financial advisor relationship. Always consult a certified financial planner (CFP) or tax professional for your personal financial planning.</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	
    <!-- In-Depth Terms of Service -->
    <section class="space-y-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pt-8 mt-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Terms of Use & Legal Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing Get Net Worth Calculator (getnetworthcalculator.com), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and all applicable financial disclaimers.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-2">1. Educational & Informational Purpose Only</h3>
      <p>
        Get Net Worth Calculator provides wealth percentile estimations, average net worth benchmarks, and financial modeling tools strictly for educational and informational purposes. The information provided does not constitute certified financial, investment, tax, or legal advice.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-2">2. No Financial Advisor Relationship</h3>
      <p>
        Use of our calculators or website content does not establish a financial advisor-client relationship. Users should consult a licensed Certified Financial Planner (CFP), CPA, or tax advisor before making major financial decisions, real estate purchases, or investment allocations.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-2">3. Limitation of Liability</h3>
      <p>
        Get Net Worth Calculator shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from the use or inability to use our tools, datasets, or calculations.
      </p>
    </section>

  
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-2">4. Intellectual Property & Brand Usage</h3>
      <p>
        All custom calculator software code, percentile calculation algorithms, mathematical models, site branding, and layout design assets are the exclusive intellectual property of Get Net Worth Calculator. Users may use our generated wealth breakdowns for personal planning or educational citations with attribution.
      </p>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-2">5. Governing Law</h3>
      <p>
        These Terms of Service are governed by and construed in accordance with applicable laws. Any legal disputes arising from website usage shall be resolved in appropriate courts of jurisdiction.
      </p>

  
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-2">6. User Responsibilities & Conduct</h3>
      <p>
        Users agree to utilize Get Net Worth Calculator solely for lawful personal or business financial modeling purposes. You agree not to attempt to reverse engineer, scrape, or overload our client-side software infrastructure or misrepresent calculated estimates as certified financial audits.
      </p>

  
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-2">Global Wealth Percentile Standards</h3>
      <p>
        Get Net Worth Calculator adheres to modern web standards, W3C accessibility guidelines, and fast Core Web Vitals responsiveness. Whether calculating liquid net worth, analyzing retirement readiness, or benchmarking household balance sheets against central bank surveys, our platform delivers instant, reliable financial modeling with zero data tracking.
      </p>
      <p>
        By accessing getnetworthcalculator.com, you acknowledge that calculations represent mathematical estimates based on published statistical distributions and do not constitute formal investment advice.
      </p>

  </main>
</Layout>
